# AzitWateringTreasureBox (35595), a Rainbow Springs treasure box, invulnerable from the moment it
# appears. The character's barehanded blows take their hit points through its script: of its 440,
# a hit of 22 leaves 418 and one of 417 leaves 1, and the hit of 1 that would take the last kills
# it. Three seconds after its death it drops letters to its killer: a draw of 1 makes two drops,
# the first draw of 6 (over 5, up to 10) the letter 8036, the second of 99 (over 95) nothing.
character Hunter 20
random 1 6 99
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegablehall.AzitWateringTreasureBox
item 8036
npc box 35595 Monster 40 0 0

hit box 22
hit box 417
hit box 1
  S SystemMessage id=95 1:0 1:0
advance 3s
  S DropItem by=box item=8036 count=1 stackable=1 animate=1
